<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">treasury</ansi>

Your company shares one treasury. Purchases, recruits, inn stays, treatment,
trading and gold gifts spend the same pool. company treasury shows its balance.
Your usual gold balance is this treasury; banked gold stays in your bank account.

Living companions contribute their old carried gold when company assets are
restored. Fallen companions' retained body assets follow resurrection rules;
when they return alive, their gold joins the pool. No gold is discarded.
Other players' companies retain their own treasury, even in an alliance.
Giving gold to your own companion is unnecessary: it is already company money.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help company</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help equipment</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help market</ansi>.
